<p>Thanks to Chritin (or whatever their new wikidot name is) for their valuable input during the creation of this article, to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1856789); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578460055" alt="Ayers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1856789); return false;">Ayers</a></span> for helping me overcome hurdles with the license compatibility for the images used, and to the real Ruta, Radek, and Ana for an awesome summer.</p>
<p>This one’s been glaring at me from my archives folder for weeks now, so I decided to finally polish it off and post it. Taking a summer job in the middle of nowhere with little to no internet connection can really you’re your creative drive, it turns out. Pair that with a friend’s loss of a beloved furry friend, and it all takes a darker turn. I hope you all enjoy!</p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong> The font for the letter section of the article might not load properly for mobile users and might display as a default font with odd spacing instead, but otherwise it loads normally on computers.</p>
