					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kybard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5717239); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5717239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606380128" alt="Kybard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5717239)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kybard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5717239); return false;" >Kybard</a></span> <span class="odate time_1570986305 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">13 Oct 2019 17:05</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4397916">
									

<p>This made me think of the way that I've seen older dogs suddenly regain a burst of youthful energy for a few months before really failing. That's what happened to my family dog, who passed a little less than a year ago.</p>
<p>I think you do a great job of conveying how lovely and aching this anomaly is without diverging too much or unnecessarily from the clinical tone. The letter might be a little too much, but that's more personal preference than an actual problem (I think it's well written).</p>
<p>Minor stuff below!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>it was discovered that SCP-4961-1 could not be physically removed from area</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Might be worth digging into this more, i.e. methods/attempts for removal and the means by which they were prevented/stopped, since it's key to the Foundation realizing that Radek's part of the anomaly.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>the flowers carried a mild cognitohazard, though in the case of the new instances the effect was noticeably more potent</p>
</blockquote>
<p>It's not really clear to me what this is meant to indicate is going on, exactly, and I'm not sure there's enough context to really guess. It's a detail that doesn't really add much as is.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>By order of Dr. Caballero, the subject, later identified as P.o.I. 291114, was buried alongside the original grave nearby. No additional incidents pertaining to Site-114 have occurred since.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I like how this could either be a display of empathy or a much colder, more clinical &quot;hey let's see if this makes things interesting again.&quot;</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

