<p>Quick note: your current version of this doesn't have a ratings module; I would put it in but I guess there's stylistic preference for where it goes that I'll leave up to you.</p>
<p>Longer form thoughts: I don't dislike this but it feels over long and like it takes too much time to build up to not much. I would highlight Addendum 4961.1 as being particularly bad here: I'm not really sure the experiments add much new we didn't already know, but I think this may be because I'm a cold, emotionless husk that doesn't really emphasise with dogs well.</p>
<p>I'm not necessarily sure I agree with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1573037246" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;">A Random Day</a></span> about the letter. It does feel overlong/over-expository to me but I think it provides a lot of interesting context as to <em>why</em> Quin cares about Ruta so much. Perhaps slimming it down somewhat would help more.</p>

